      "text": "St Helen's opens today! 🖤\nThe sun is shining and it's your first chance to see the redeveloped ground and get behind Swansea RFC as they face Ebbw Vale RFC at 2:30 🏉\nIt's the first milestone in getting the stadium up and running and a long awaited return for the Whites to St Helen's 🤍\n(1/2) 🧵",
